## Widen the pattern Details pane with KPI badges and a full-width diagram
================================================================================

Context: The Discover Details pane stacked a narrow diagram above the member
list. The diagram now spans the full detail pane, run-level and pattern-level
KPIs use the shared `sim-kpi-tile` badges, and the pattern list sits in a
narrow left rail.

