   Workspace layout: `pat-list-pane` + `pat-detail-pane`.
2. src/front/static/simulation/js/simulation-patterns.js
   Run KPIs and selected-pattern KPIs as tiles; full-width SVG; member rows
   with type badges.
3. src/front/static/simulation/css/simulation.css
   Workspace / diagram / member styles on `--db-*` tokens.
4. tests/units/front/test_simulation_page_contract.py
